OL,3,AArrest after woman, 80, 'doused and set
OL,4,Aon fire'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after police
OL,7,Fsaid an 80-year-old woman was "doused
OL,8,Fand set on fire" outside her home.
OL,10,FOfficers were called at about 12:45 GMT
OL,11,Fon Monday to reports Brenda Raymond had
OL,12,Fbeen found in a first-floor communal
OL,13,Farea in Caractacus Cottage View,
OL,14,FWatford.
OL,16,FHertfordshire Police said she sustained
OL,17,Flife-threatening injuries and was taken
OL,18,Fto hospital, where she remains in a
OL,19,Fcritical condition.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
